      "short": "$\\frac{4n}{m}$\n\nReplace $m^0$ by 1, then cancel common factors.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{20m^0}{n}\\times\\frac{n^2}{5m}&=\\frac{20n^2}{5mn} \\\\ &=\\frac{4n}{m}\\qquad(m,n\\ne0)\\end{align*}$$",
